ted in toto in the same cassette D  Gross Description by  LAURA NAKATSUKA Resident  ALIYAH RAHEMTULLAH  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Kenneth Lloyd Minaker  M D  Dianne Georgian smith  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  12 00  CORE BIOPSY , Absent.
