d and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 00 at 15 35 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh  in four separate parts   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  Labeled  left breast lumpectomy  is a 7 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm excisional biopsy specimen which contains two needle localization wires and is oriented by the surgeon as one  clip   medial margin  two clips   inferior margin and three clips   lateral margin   The specimen is inked blue on the superior half and black on the inferior half and serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x 2 x 1 5cm blood filled space which is surrounded by dense fibrous tissue which is focally gritty and with soft yellow foci  The blood filled space abuts the anterior margin at the junction of the superior and inferior border  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is fibrofatty and otherwise unremarkable  SECTION CODE A  Blood filled space with closest  anterior  margin  B  Anterior margin  C  Representative section at the superior margin  D  Inferior margin  E  Superior margin  medial  F  Lateral margin  G H  Unremarkable breast parenchyma away from the blood filled area  X  Lateral margin  en face  Y  Inferior margin  en face  Z  Medial margin  en face  AA DD  Other sections of gritty  yellow foci  Labeled  lateral new margin  stitch at new margin  is a 5 x 2 x 1cm fragment of breast tissue containing one suture designated by the surgeon as the new margin  The stitched side is inked black  the opposite side is inked blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable breast tissue  entirely submitted in cassettes I through K  Labeled  new anterior medial margin  stitch at new margin  is a 2 x 2 x 1cm fragment of tissue oriented by the surgeon with a suture designating new anterior margin  The stitched side is inked black and the opposite side is inked blue  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable breast tissue  entirely submitted in cassettes L and M  Labeled  new medial margin with clips  is a 7 x 5 x 0 7cm fragment of breast oriented by the surgeon as one clip equals deep margin  two clips equals inferior margin  three clips equal anterior  superficial  margin  The specimen is inked black on the medial surface  blue on the lateral surface  Serially sectioned from anterior  superficial  to deep to reveal unremarkable breast parenchyma  submitted entirely as follows  N W  Anterior to deep with R  T and V in the superior half and S  U  W in the inferior half  X  Deepest margin  Gross Description by  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD Resident  TAI YUAN LIN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Rosa Sung Eun Choi  M D  David R Whittaker  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT  NEW LATERAL MARGINS    EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT  NEW ANTERIOR MEDIAL MARGIN    EXCISI PART D  BREAST  LEFT  NEW MEDIAL MARGIN    EXCISION   report_end  , Absent.
